      carriers: carrier(path: "src/v2/compiler/self_host/stage0_production_target.dag"),
      line: ticket(t: updated(t: updated(t: fields(
        headline: "Make the new generator able to produce one real module the seed crate can use",
        boundary: "One real module from the repository, read off disk the way the crate's own modules arrive, comes out of the new generator in a form the existing crate accepts: visible where the crate calls across module boundaries, carrying the integer the crate's other files already carry, and with every expression in that module's body actually written out. Whether production ever selects it is the step after this one.",
        displaced_cost: "The step below assumed a real module was already producible and it is not, so without this the flip has nothing to flip. Measuring it here stops a milestone being recorded against a module the generator cannot write.",
        first_slice: "Take the smallest real subject the census finds -- the one corpus module with a single declaration -- and walk its first refusal repeatedly: emit it, name the exact shape that stopped, add that one shape, emit again.",
        red_control: "Each capability is separated by its own failing control rather than one generic bad-output check: an item emitted without visibility must fail where the real caller reaches it, and the wrong integer must fail at the exact position the crate's existing files fix. Emitted text alone is not accepted -- the module has to stand in for the real file in a copy of the real crate, build there, and answer a table of inputs the same way the current one does.",
        out_of_scope: "Not changing which generator production selects, not matching the old generator's bytes, and not widening to modules with several declarations -- that widening waits for a consumer that needs it, and would not by itself make the large integer module producible.",
        handback: "The source tree and module named, the emitted source, the build result in the real crate, the behavioral table, and the remaining shapes still refused."
      ), on: "2026-09-30", note: "In progress: #12623, #12443 and #12715 merged."), on: "2026-09-30", note: "Not yet centered: active lane work; scope moves with each emit PR.")),
      dispatch: dispatchable(),
