        first_slice: "The acceptance witness dag/test/claim/shell/shell_dag_compile_pool_slice_install_witness_test.dag is authored, pinned at launch, and RED. Do NOT edit it — an edit refuses verification as oracle-moved. Make it green by doing M1-M3. M1: model the typed systemd unit-file install and typed staging argv. M2: rebind the three construction sites, retire the retained site per the module's own declared trigger, and delete the shell text assembly. M3: witness green by execution.",
