        out_of_scope: "No change to submission, verification, or publication gates; reviewers, auditors and probes keep hard step budgets.",
        handback: "The outcome, the rooted projection, the adjudication boundary, durable cadence state, and witnesses for the red controls."
      ), on: "2026-09-30", note: "Not yet centered: needs a centering plan: authored 2026-09-30 with no attempts, and its first slice has not been confirmed bounded.")),
      dispatch: dispatchable(),
