      carriers: carrier(path: "docs/plans/namespace-unique-on-chain-operational-plan.md"),
      line: ticket(t: level_fields(
          headline: "Decide every name one canonical way",
          boundary: "The namespace cut as gunbc.namespace_cut_stage stages it: F-0, XL-0 to XL-4 (evidence and the reference-derived graph), ACT-0 and XL-5 (waves), XL-6 (atomic cutover), XL-7 (grammar deletion). Rows are the stages that still have open work. The stage chain itself stays in the module.",
          approach: "XL-2 and XL-3 wait on frontend prerequisites (LoweringOccurrenceProjection, ServiceModuleLowering, ResolverBoundDeclaringIdentity). The declaration-identity switch-over is the XL-6 construction, built in shadow now. Per the 2026-09-12 interlock edge, XL-6 and XL-7 run after seed retirement.",
