          approach: "One worker per roster, each bound to the roster's existing witness; grandfathered-roster removals wait until the dead set is measured by a live population join (a name-grep join flags 76 identities, most synthesized).",
          red_control: "A roster row that is deleted while its identity is still live, or a dead identity left in a roster, keeps this open.",
