          headline: "DP-M3: extdeps-scope closure halved",
          boundary: "The legacy extdeps scope manifest (dag/gunbc/legacy_extdeps_scope_frontier.tsv via gunbc.extdeps_scope_frontier) halved, and tools.extdeps_scope_placement_gate enrolled on an executing route before anything is counted. The unimported-bare-provider roster the census pairs with this is not on this line (v2.workflow.floor_unimported_bare_provider_debt_roster exists on main only).",
