          boundary: "extdeps.filesystem.filesystem_io filesystem_absence_establishment_adoption_standing driven to zero open sites (each routed through filesystem_file_observation / filesystem_entry_presence), and filesystem_read_outcome_adoption_standing re-measured at identity grain.",
