      line: ticket(t: level_fields(
          headline: "Run programs through one demand engine, paying only for what changed",
          boundary: "gunbc.plans.demand_engine_program milestones M1.b to M7 plus D13 (derived dependency demand and composition-root binding). Already landed: M0 (#11428), M1.a (#11447), D9 partition (Pkg7), M3a (#12401, inferred), D11/E2 (#12391), D12 (#11528). The plan is the design authority. These rows are its milestones as work.",
          approach: "Serial replacement migrations in the plan's order. Each milestone lands with one production consumer switched and its displaced route deleted in the same change.",
