          handback: "The plan's own deletion condition: M7 exit holds and every milestone's deletions are census-verified."
        )),
      parent: in_project(project: "v2-compiler-live", contribution: "The live compiler's driver is a demand over its universe, so a run pays only for what changed. The engine is how v2 stays affordable as the required route."),
