      line: ticket(t: updated(t: fields(
          headline: "v2 parses and types its native test target end to end",
          boundary: "The target is the test label //v2/test/parse/expression_bodied_fn_decl_parse:all, taken through ingest, lowering, resolve and infer on the native route. The population is derived from the label, not counted: there is no list of seven to keep in sync. Every refusal is removed at its root.",
          displaced_cost: "Until the target's members type end to end, no v2 frontend claim has a real subject behind it.",
          first_slice: "Phase A, typed endpoint: every member reaches infer on the native route on one combined commit. Every member currently refuses at prepare/infer (projection_receiver_declaration_unavailable). The blocker chain, in order: count unbound (#13307), then the bare filter (filter/any retirement); call result type underived (#13325, integrated with #13210 match payload instantiation); literal elaboration (#13320); from_code_point unbound (#13408, #13453, #13378); kernel-text concat (#13284); Cardinality ambiguous (#13379); Optional ambiguous (Optional de-fork PR B); EmptyPattern unbound; filesystem_io unreachable at lowering (service_realization_unreachable, XL-2). Phase B, execution: each member reaches its expected verdict natively and the label becomes an executing required check. That phase owes iteration direction for map/all (#13069), a v2 evaluation meaning for roster-bound concat (#13284) and NativeTestPassed rows (#13210). Each N7-path PR records the label run at its head and its base, and reports the movement as the blocker it cleared and the blocker that is next.",
          red_control: "Any member of the target refusing before type inference, or refusing by blaming an import target (native_import_target_attribution), keeps this red.",
          out_of_scope: "Whole-corpus refusals; emission. The type_env cycle-time investigation is a regression investigation, not this node's wall.",
          handback: "Every member of the target typed, with the run receipt for the label."
        ), on: "2026-10-06", note: "Rewritten to the successor chain: the blocker chain to the typed endpoint, then execution as a required check; the N7-0 to N7-5 ledger text is replaced.")),
      parent: in_project(project: "v2-frontend", contribution: "The native test target is the smallest real subject v2 must read and type end to end."),
    ),
