          boundary: "gunbc.host_reach_identity_probe probe_reachable_with_principal uses [\"id\",\"-un\"] and probe_ready_target_once uses [\"hostname\"]. The existing builders differ: extdeps.tools.id id_uid_argv is [\"id\",\"-u\"] (numeric) and hostname_short_read_argv is [\"hostname\",\"-s\"].",
          displaced_cost: "Hand argv is invocation text no builder owns.",
          first_slice: "Add an id_user_name_argv builder and decide whether -s belongs in the hostname read.",
          red_control: "The probe symbols carrying a literal \"id\" or \"hostname\" argv.",
          out_of_scope: "Other probe modules.",
          handback: "The builders, the probe rebound, and a witness asserting builder argv equals the probe argv."
        ), on: "2026-09-30", note: "Not ready: swapping in the existing builders would change the comparison against the principal name; a user-name builder and a hostname -s decision come first.")),
      dispatch: dispatchable(),
      parent: in_project(project: "dp-m2-shell-residue-retired", contribution: "The identity probe's hand id/hostname argv is shell residue in a read-only probe; builders make it checkable."),
