        displaced_cost: "P-256 and SHA-384/512 have no honest home without it.",
        first_slice: "Limb carrier and add-with-carry over two limbs, with its witness.",
        red_control: "A carry dropped between limbs reds; a limb outside its width refuses at admission.",
        out_of_scope: "Curve arithmetic itself belongs to the CRYPTO-0 curve row.",
