      identity: "rn_KKAGM3C9SB50J0KSHGPYXDTM4J",
      id: "egress-encoding-0-cbor-der-landing",
      owner: "primitive-egress",
      carriers: carrier(path: "docs/plans/demand-engine-program.md"),
      line: ticket(t: updated(t: updated(t: fields(
        headline: "ENCODING-0: land pure .dag CBOR, DER and X.509 parsing (gunbc#11727)",
        boundary: "Pure .dag CBOR, DER and X.509 parsing, reconciled in quarry/11895, DEFERRED on its witness redesign (supplied pre-parsed values plus one real-bytes inhabitance claim) or the kernel arms. Five acceptance obligations, each with a discriminating control: (1) DER OID arcs bounded before pending * 128 + low overflows; (2) the App Attest bundle-version extension enforced before the ECDSA frontier returns; (3) a BIT STRING with nonzero declared-unused bits refuses; (4) the DER primitive/constructed bit enforced IN BOTH DIRECTIONS (controls: Certificate SEQUENCE 0x30 -> 0x10 refuses; a primitive universal value with the constructed bit refuses); (5) CBOR map keys in deterministic order.",
        displaced_cost: "The attestation parsers sit approved but unlandable, and every consumer of std.octet_span waits on them.",
        first_slice: "Re-draft from gunbc#11895 at its immutable quarry head 8fc4448575cd4955c2b3b6c34ac6e300f41d31f1 (tag quarry/11895) with the redesigned witnesses, repairing the five known defects in the boundary, each with its named refusal control.",
        red_control: "The three mutant REDs of the gunbc#11727 receipt stay red, and each of the five boundary defects has a discriminating input that refuses.",
        out_of_scope: "content_hash consolidation, UTF-8 causes and the bytes seam are their own rows.",
