        boundary: "One cold/warm receipt from the two sibling processes the provider row names -- the nominal witnesses fold and the generated-artifact drift gate, one job, one built binary. Report end-to-end wall, peak RSS, and the fold's subject digest, which must be EQUAL between armed and unarmed: a store that changes a verdict is a defect, not a saving. Read hits, misses, rejections, refusals, throughput and LIVE OCCUPANCY off the [typed-store-persist] line the floor receipt already emits.",
        displaced_cost: "The store is armed by nothing today, so it displaces nothing until this runs. Until then the tier is implemented and unmeasured, and the design's projected figures (8.3 min -> ~1 min preparation, 32 -> ~20 min per push) are withdrawn rather than carried, because they do not follow from the key the design proposed.",
