        red_control: "An unarmed and an armed run of the same commit must print the SAME subject digest; a difference falsifies the store rather than the measurement. A second armed run over a warm store must show hits, or the store is not being reached and the whole tier is inert.",
        out_of_scope: "No widening of required_gate_prefixes, no seeding workflow, no scheduled verification job, and no parallelism work.",
        handback: "The cold/warm receipt with both wall times, both peak RSS figures, the two digests, and the decision it implies: keep and arm, or delete the tier."
      )),
